    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Batch open (SELECTION-003, the funding-footprint attack):\\nopen many channels inside one invocation, so the\\ntransaction footprint, the hub's SAC balance reads, and the\\ninstance writes are paid once for the batch instead of once\\nper channel. Each entry runs the identical `open` body \\xe2\\x80\\x94\\nsame auth, same SAC transfer, same channel entry \\xe2\\x80\\x94 so a\\nbatch-opened channel is indistinguishable from a singly\\nopened one. Sensitivity: each distinct funder in the batch\\nmust authorize inside this one transaction; the measured\\nshape is one funder opening many channels (distribution).",
      "name": "open_batch",
      "inputs": [
